### 2. **Specific Problem Areas:**
   - **Problem 1:** The UI does not support dynamic interactions like updating the cart without reloading the page, which could frustrate users when browsing products.
     - **Suggestions:** Implement AJAX calls to update the cart dynamically. This will improve the overall user experience and make the application feel more responsive.
   
   - **Problem 2:** The product listing and cart functionalities are tightly coupled to text file storage. Any corruption or mismanagement of these files can lead to the application failing.
