### Summary:
The architecture of this online shopping center is mostly practical for a small project, benefiting greatly from Flask¡¯s simplicity and easy data handling. However, implementing improvements such as dynamic front-end interactions, robust data validation, and structured file handling will significantly enhance the functionality and usability of the application. These architectural enhancements will lead to a more maintainable codebase while providing a better user experience.
